  sequenceId: Lobby_Group02_YoungMan
  notes: 'Optional young-man and work-unit conversation. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_No_Audio_Tags_Native_English.md,
    stable marker Lobby_Group02_YoungMan. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Work Unit
    text: 'This section''s solid. One small thing: in the second paragraph, ''in
      summary'' sounds more formal than ''anyway.'''
    holdSeconds: 7.565094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Young Man
    text: Mm-hm.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Work Unit
    text: Want me to bring in last week's chart?
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Young Man
    text: Yeah, thanks.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Work Unit
    text: Before I go back to the document, do you still want help with that message
      to your mom?
    holdSeconds: 7.9424524
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Young Man
    text: Yeah. Tell her work ran late. I don't want it to sound like I'm blowing
      her off again.
    holdSeconds: 7.9424524
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Work Unit
    text: 'How about: ''Hey, Mom. Work ran late, so don''t wait for me at dinner.
      I''ll come by tomorrow and bring something good.'''
    holdSeconds: 9.451886
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Young Man
    text: That's good. Send it.
    holdSeconds: 2.6594338
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Work Unit
    text: Sent. She says, 'Okay, sweetheart. Don't work too late. I'll see you tomorrow.'
    holdSeconds: 6.0556602
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Young Man
    text: Perfect. Thanks. That's one less thing to worry about.
    holdSeconds: 4.5462265
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
